    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>You are trained with @Compendium[pf2e.equipment-srd.dUC8Fsa6FZtVikS3]{Composite Longbows}, @Compendium[pf2e.equipment-srd.e4NwsnPnpQKbDZ9F]{Composite Shortbows}, @Compendium[pf2e.equipment-srd.MVAWttmT0QDa7LsV]{Longbows}, @Compendium[pf2e.equipment-srd.hIgqLgH3YcLZBeoT]{Shortbows}, @Compendium[pf2e.equipment-srd.t5FbyZtRL4qV0V7k]{Flail}, and @Compendium[pf2e.equipment-srd.mVxA9E2ernBL6fM6]{War Flail}.</p>\n<p>In addition, you gain access to all uncommon bugbear weapons. For the purpose of determining your proficiency, martial bugbear weapons are simple weapons and advanced bugbear weapons are martial weapons.</p>"
    },
